/","source-block-641","Source",["Loop brace"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Marker/Loop%20Brace/","source-block-654","Ableton/Live/UG/06 Arrangement View",["Loop brace","Source"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Marker/Loop%20Brace/","source-block-698","Ableton/Live/UG/06 Arrangement View/06 The Arrangement Loop · 6.6 The Arrangement Loop",["Loop brace","Source"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Marker/Time%20Signature%20Marker/","source-block-88","Time signature marker",[]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Marker/Time%20Signature%20Marker/","source-block-114","Changes the time signature from its position onward. Markers sit just below the beat-time ruler and are hidden when a Set has no meter changes.",["Time signature marker"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Marker/Time%20Signature%20Marker/","source-block-261","Insert one with Insert Time Signature Change in the Create menu or the scrub area's context menu; edit it with Cmd+R (Mac) / Ctrl+R (Win).",["Time signature marker"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Marker/Time%20Signature%20Marker/","source-block-403","Source",["Time signature marker"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Marker/Time%20Signature%20Marker/","source-block-416","Ableton/Live/UG/06 Arrangement View",["Time signature marker","Source"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Marker/Time%20Signature%20Marker/","source-block-460","Ableton/Live/UG/06 Arrangement View/05 Time Signature Changes · 6.5 Time Signature Changes",["Time signature marker","Source"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Scrub%20Area/","source-block-85","Scrub area",[]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Scrub%20Area/","source-block-100","The strip above the tracks: click anywhere to start playback from that point, or hold the mouse button to loop a short section at the global launch quantization.",["Scrub area"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Scrub%20Area/","source-block-265","Controls",["Scrub area"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%2